      "tree": {
        "sha": "8253a73835324a8236fafe916ff4c56d65a160e0",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/8253a73835324a8236fafe916ff4c56d65a160e0"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 8253a73835324a8236fafe916ff4c56d65a160e0\nparent 18c05d93016b28a9afd4c716dfe00b6e0accb30b\nauthor Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1784504016 -0700\ncommitter Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1784514079 -0700\n\nvalidation: handle null mempool on delete\n\nKernel can create a `ChainstateManager` without a mempool.\nDeleting an AssumeUTXO chainstate then dereferences the previous chainstate's null mempool pointer.\n\nAllow the previous chainstate to have no mempool, matching `AddChainstate()`.\nCover the reindex/wipe lifecycle.\n",
